Displayed Wikipedia content (CC BY-SA)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WikiDrift reads and displays text from Wikipedia (article prose, diffs, and
quoted passages) obtained from public Wikimedia APIs and dumps. That displayed
text is authored by Wikipedia contributors and is licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution-ShareAlike License (CC BY-SA 4.0), NOT under the Apache
License that covers this software.

Any redistribution or public display of that Wikipedia-derived text must:
  - attribute the Wikipedia contributors (e.g. a link back to the source
    article and its revision history), and
  - remain available under CC BY-SA 4.0 (share-alike).

See https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Reusing_Wikipedia_content and
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/.

