Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Token-level authorship is computed via WikiWho (hosted API) and the open-source
wikiwho_rs engine (github.com/Schuwi/wikiwho_rs), each under its own license.
Revision metadata comes from the MediaWiki Action API. These services and tools
retain their respective licenses and terms.
